19/02/21/vipshop-holdings-limited-vips-q4-2018-earnings-con.aspx"},{"c":"VIPS 2019 Q1","e":"vips","d":"2019-05-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Eric Ya Shen","x":"In addition, we continued to make good progress on cost reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/23/vipshop-holdings-limited-vips-q1-2019-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"VIPS 2019 Q1","e":"vips","d":"2019-05-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Donghao Yang","x":"Further, our cost reduction efforts also came into play as we streamlined resources invested into sort of loss-making businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/23/vipshop-holdings-limited-vips-q1-2019-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"VIPS 2019 Q3","e":"vips","d":"2019-11-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Donghao Yang","x":"And also in this past quarter, we cut also on our headcount in our fulfillment operations with another contributor to our cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/13/vipshop-holdings-limited-vips-q3-2019-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"VIPS 2019 Q4","e":"vips","d":"2020-03-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Eric Ya Shen","x":"[Foreign Speech] We have experimented with the live streaming format in the past.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/05/vipshop-holdings-limited-vips-q4-2019-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"VIPS 2019 Q4","e":"vips","d":"2020-03-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Eric Ya Shen","x":"We haven't had a lot of successes, and therefore it's not a core initiative for us and we're not going to invest heavily into live streaming at this moment either.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/05/vipshop-holdings-limited-vips-q4-2019-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"VIPS 2019 Q4","e":"vips","d":"2020-03-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Donghao Yang","x":"…expenses were 5.9% as compared with 3.1% in the prior year period, primarily attributable to a severance payment of RMB652 million and other provision of assets of RMB154 million related to the discontinuation of Pinjun as well as an impairment of RMB200 million related to our Tai'an and…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/05/vipshop-holdings-limited-vips-q4-2019-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"VIPS 2020 Q1","e":"vips","d":"2020-05-27","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Eric Ya Shen","x":"And also, in the past, we said we didn't essentially invest into live streaming, but we are also starting to look into this field, for example, working with the link [Phonetic] a little more and so on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/27/vipshop-holdings-limited-vips-q1-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"VIPS 2020 Q2","e":"vips","d":"2020-08-19","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Eric Ya Shen","x":"So we are quite positive about the second half outlook. [Foreign Speech] So, Thomas, regarding your second question on competition who are doing some live streaming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/19/vipshop-holdings-limited-vips-q2-2020-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"VIPS 2020 Q2","e":"vips","d":"2020-08-19","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Eric Ya Shen","x":"And regarding your question on live streaming, we've tried live streaming e-commerce for about four months now.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/19/vipshop-holdings-limited-vips-q2-2020-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"VIPS 2020 Q4","e":"vips","d":"2021-02-25","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jessie Fan","x":"On your question regarding live streaming and short video.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/vipshop-holdings-limited-vips-q4-2020-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"VIPS 2020 Q4","e":"vips","d":"2021-02-25","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jessie Fan","x":"We do believe that live streaming app and short video apps are where a lot of our customers are spending a lot of time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/vipshop-holdings-limited-vips-q4-2020-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"VIPS 2021 Q1","e":"vips","d":"2021-05-19","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Eric Ya Shen","x":"…Speech] We actually a various -- very diversified customer acquisition channels, including targeted advertising, including endorsements on TV shows and reality shows as well as cellphone pre-installation, and at the same time, we're also exploring more into short videos, live streaming and so on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/19/vipshop-holdings-limited-vips-q1-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"VIPS 2021 Q1","e":"vips","d":"2021-05-19","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Eric Ya Shen","x":"The one thing that is worth mentioning is that we are looking to invest a little more into live streaming in terms of customer acquisition.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/19/vipshop-holdings-limited-vips-q1-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"VIPS 2021 Q2","e":"vips","d":"2021-08-18","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jessie Fan","x":"Okay, let me translate the first answer to the first question in terms of live streaming models.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/18/vipshop-holdings-limited-vips-q2-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"VIPS 2021 Q2","e":"vips","d":"2021-08-18","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jessie Fan","x":"There are lot of platforms that are selling through live streaming, whether it's branded or it's slow -- in-season, slow-moving old inventories, I think these platforms primarily are capturing a lot of customers attention.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/18/vipshop-holdings-limited-vips-q2-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"VIPS 2021 Q3","e":"vips","d":"2021-11-18","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Eric Ya Shen","x":"We do notice that live streaming platforms, they do attract user traffic, but from what we've observed so far, they are more -- offer part of the brand's multi-channel marketing strategy that brings incremental traffic with -- no matter whether it's shelf space or short video-based or…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/18/vipshop-holdings-limited-vips-q3-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"VIPS 2021 Q4","e":"vips","d":"2022-02-23","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Ya Shen","x":"I think -- we think that live streaming platforms, they have take what they can take in the past from shelf space to e-commerce platforms.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/23/vipshop-holdings-vips-q4-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"VIPS 2021 Q4","e":"vips","d":"2022-02-23","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Thomas Chong","x":"And then, finally, that is more relating to competition, can management comment about live streaming online shopping competition in China and how it affects our business?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/23/vipshop-holdings-vips-q4-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"VIPS 2021 Q4","e":"vips","d":"2022-02-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ya Shen","x":"And adding to that, actually the conversion for standard products is actually higher than that of apparel related-tariff categories for the same amount of traffic.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/23/vipshop-holdings-vips-q4-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"VIPS 2022 Q1","e":"vips","d":"2022-05-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Cui","x":"Our gross margin showed resilience after we implemented a number of cost-saving measures.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/19/vipshop-holdings-vips-q1-2022-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"VIPS 2022 Q1","e":"vips","d":"2022-05-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Cui","x":"So this year, we have taken many cost saving measures to improve our margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/19/vipshop-holdings-vips-q1-2022-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"VIPS 2022 Q2","e":"vips","d":"2022-08-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Cui","x":"This was achieved as we identified many opportunities to streamline the cost structure in both apparel and nonapparel categories and managed to improve category gross margins effectively.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/19/vipshop-holdings-vips-q2-2022-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"VIPS 2022 Q2","e":"vips","d":"2022-08-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jessie Zheng","x":"I just want to try to share that we actually have taken many cost-saving initiatives this year to try to stabilize and improve our gross margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/19/vipshop-holdings-vips-q2-2022-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"VIPS 2025 Q1","e":"vips","d":"2025-05-20","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Eric Ya Shen","x":"Although there are a lot of business models in terms of how to sell the products, including live streaming platforms or shelf-based e-commerce, the long-term factors that drive consumers in terms of where they choose to shop have always been great merchandise, great prices, and great services.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/20/vipshop-vips-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VIPS 2025 Q1","e":"vips","d":"2025-05-20","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Eric Ya Shen","x":"In terms of the tariff question, we have very limited exposure to it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/20/vipshop-vips-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VIPS 2025 Q1","e":"vips","d":"2025-05-20","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Thomas Chong","x":"Can management comment about the monthly GMV trend so far we are seeing in Q2, given a lot of events happening like tariff, macro headwinds, etcetera?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/20/vipshop-vips-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VIPS 2025 Q3","e":"vips","d":"2025-11-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Alicia Yap","x":"The first question is, can management elaborate on the details, changes, and restructuring of your merchandising team, and do these changes help the latest quarter performance?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/20/vipshop-vips-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[34,1,5472,0,0,0,3821,1278],[36,1,5428,0,0,0,3850,1102],[37,1,4504,0,0,0,3389,656],[38,1,5246,0,0,0,3765,953],[39,1,5221,0,0,0,3439,1044],[40,1,5777,0,0,0,3861,1426],[41,1,5767,0,0,0,3758,1547],[42,1,5976,0,0,0,4088,1444],[43,1,6200,0,0,0,4356,1420],[44,1,5067,0,0,0,3856,817],[45,1,4242,0,0,0,3124,624],[46,1,4955,0,0,0,3869,718],[47,1,4131,0,0,0,3177,640],[48,1,4918,0,0,0,3789,833],[49,1,3906,0,0,0,3049,628],[50,1,4913,0,0,0,3787,763],[61,1,4038,0,0,0,3331,446],[63,1,3554,0,0,0,2976,396],[65,1,3291,0,0,0,2392,167],[66,1,3718,0,0,0,3224,179]],"cinema":[[34,1,5472,0,0,0,3821,1278],[36,1,5428,0,0,0,3850,1102],[37,1,4504,0,0,0,3389,656],[38,1,5246,0,0,0,3765,953],[39,1,5221,0,0,0,3439,1044],[40,1,5777,0,0,0,3861,1426],[41,1,5767,0,0,0,3758,1547],[42,1,5976,0,0,0,4088,1444],[43,1,6200,0,0,0,4356,1420],[44,1,5067,0,0,0,3856,817],[45,1,4242,0,0,0,3124,624],[46,1,4955,0,0,0,3869,718],[47,1,4131,0,0,0,3177,640],[48,1,4918,0,0,0,3789,833],[49,1,3906,0,0,0,3049,628],[50,1,4913,0,0,0,3787,763],[61,1,4038,0,0,0,3331,446],[63,1,3554,0,0,0,2976,396],[65,1,3291,0,0,0,2392,167],[66,1,3718,0,0,0,3224,179]],"imax":[[34,1,5472,0,0,0,3821,1278],[36,1,5428,0,0,0,3850,1102],[37,1,4504,0,0,0,3389,656],[38,1,5246,0,0,0,3765,953],[39,1,5221,0,0,0,3439,1044],[40,1,5777,0,0,0,3861,1426],[41,1,5767,0,0,0,3758,1547],[42,1,5976,0,0,0,4088,1444],[43,1,6200,0,0,0,4356,1420],[44,1,5067,0,0,0,3856,817],[45,1,4242,0,0,0,3124,624],[46,1,4955,0,0,0,3869,718],[47,1,4131,0,0,0,3177,640],[48,1,4918,0,0,0,3789,833],[49,1,3906,0,0,0,3049,628],[50,1,4913,0,0,0,3787,763],[61,1,4038,0,0,0,3331,446],[63,1,3554,0,0,0,2976,396],[65,1,3291,0,0,0,2392,1